{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would happen if crows evolved further than apes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Crowded, a dynamic avian citybuilder where you\u2019re tasked with building a society in the sky. As a cunning crow you\u2019ll need every tool at your disposal and plenty of wiles to keep the flock safe, fed and happy. After all, there\u2019s no \u2018i\u2019 in Murder!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/6401d3b5e9aa7bf0cfcbb91d5e4f0d57.poster.avif?t=1755176110\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/6401d3b5e9aa7bf0cfcbb91d5e4f0d57.webm?t=1755176110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/6401d3b5e9aa7bf0cfcbb91d5e4f0d57.mp4?t=1755176110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for delicious bugs and building materials, managing resources wisely so your feathered friends get what they need. Take flight and explore a landscape of lush forests and sprawling meadows, planting new trees to expand your territory. Strategically design your nest-city to support and shelter your flock. As you innovate, you\u2019ll also evolve, developing new skills and abilities to lead your flock to greatness.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/276b6480448fa7d431c19747f0602f0d.poster.avif?t=1755176110\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/276b6480448fa7d431c19747f0602f0d.webm?t=1755176110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/276b6480448fa7d431c19747f0602f0d.mp4?t=1755176110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The world beyond may be dangerous, but you\u2019re crafty enough to not just survive, but thrive.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engineer </strong>an intricate network of crow nests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge </strong>for resources out in the world!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate </strong>the wind for travel and convenience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore </strong>a beautiful landscape from the sky!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve </strong>as you go with new skills and enhancements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired </strong>by real life crows, this is a city builder like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/6f4c18b12c82b614a42a49bc909cf212.poster.avif?t=1755176110\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/6f4c18b12c82b614a42a49bc909cf212.webm?t=1755176110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/extras/6f4c18b12c82b614a42a49bc909cf212.mp4?t=1755176110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3282600?t=1755176110","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/24dea172eccbb6eaef846248433760be6ed38921/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755176110","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282600/871d1370b99504fe90f06976190e8730